# Copy to private/.env and fill in. The whole private/ directory is gitignored.
#
# Optional: only needed if you drop a licensed breach connector into
# private/connectors/. The public build ships without one.
# NESHER_API_KEY=

# Optional: override the Chrome/Chromium binary used by browser-driving tools.
# AETHER_CHROME=

# Optional model / behaviour overrides (all have sane defaults):
# AETHER_MODEL=claude-opus-5
# AETHER_EFFORT=medium
# AETHER_OWNER=George

# Optional: seed custom modules (a local command, or an API with your key) that
# appear pre-configured in Settings -> Modules. Create private/modules.json —
# see the README "Modules" section for the shape. The whole private/ dir is gitignored.
